Package: SPARKS
Title: Single-cell Pipeline for Analysis of RNA-seq Systems
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: person("lavauxt", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "lavauxt@example.com")
Description: SPARKS (Single-cell Pipeline for Analysis of RNA-seq Systems) is a
    modular scRNA-seq pipeline using Seurat, SingleR and scDblFinder. Results of a
    run are gathered into one self-contained interactive HTML report (plotly
    figures in tabs), and explored in a Loupe-style Shiny app that re-runs
    differential expression, re-clustering, signature scoring and enrichment on
    selected cells as cached 'targets' analyses.
